    "text": "Ministry of land and Parliamentary Reforms Ref. No.: :- 4-3/2/2016/CEB /474. My Ref. No. : DER/LAN/LAQUI/Al/I0/1.I hereby give notice under sub - section (1) of section of theland acquisition Act No 28 of 1964 that the governmentintends to acquire the following land which is required for apublic purpose.",
